  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expanding Freedom Lifemap through DepEd&#x2019;s Alternative Learning System (ALS) to Address OSAEC Risks</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen the protection, resilience, and educational success of high-risk learners in the Philippines Department of Education&#x2019;s Alternative Learning System (ALS) by integrating EverFree&#x2019;s Freedom Lifemap (FLM) and survivor-centered case management model into ALS centers, providing preventive education, psychosocial support, financial assistance, and structured monitoring</narrative>
  </description>
